<title>USA: Allegiance Corp Q3 net declines.</title>
<headline>Allegiance Corp Q3 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>MCGAW PARK, Ill. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			 18,900		   19,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,092,800		1,155,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  54,800		   54,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.84		    $0.96</p>
<p> Net			 45,800		   52,400</p>
<p> Revs		   3,294,800		3,392,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  54,800		   54,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are pro forma.</p>
<p>Allegiance was spun off from Baxter International Inc on October 1.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
